window.CURRENT_TASK={"task_id": "L3-FUC-049-A5", "layer": "L3", "target_id": "FUC-049", "artifact_id": "FUC-049-A5", "title": "FUC-049 Coordinate Surveillance Transmit Filters / A5", "protocol_version": "L3_PURE_COVERAGE_3.0.0", "artifact_sha256": "d213dee2fec92df52dcb232d62460ceacee6812d032922c5e19df9c58d624256", "source_sha256": "40e0827f373b73731838c63950f540172969d6c83af6ebea4de3c9f3f5722e99", "reference_sha256": "f7bcbea17ee2a5b86d9e817ed83e8cfafac4de3e008fe4c98dd3d02919a0a8c4", "reference_origin": "agent_reference_reused", "instructions": "<pre>本包明确复用冻结的 Agent 来源参照，属于人工覆盖复评，不构成“真人独立建立参照”。不展示任何候选评分。FULL为全部实质含义覆盖；PARTIAL不折半分；NOT_COVERED未覆盖；CONTRADICTED矛盾；UNRESOLVED未决。来源未决统一保留在分母，不能猜成已确认；技术失败另列且留在分母。允许七槽联合表达。</pre>", "material_html": "<h3>Coordinate Surveillance Transmit Filters</h3><p>给定参与者：C2 JU</p><div class=\"source\"><p>许可来源：milstd6016b_sec4</p><a href=\"assets/40e0827f373b73731838c63950f540172969d6c83af6ebea4de3c9f3f5722e99.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">打开完整来源 PDF（含原页图像）</a> · <a href=\"assets/40e0827f373b73731838c63950f540172969d6c83af6ebea4de3c9f3f5722e99.txt\" target=\"_blank\">同版全文文本</a></div><h3>冻结共同参照：已有 Agent 来源参照，非人工金标准</h3><pre>{&#x27;goal&#x27;: &#x27;Coordinate Link 16 surveillance transmit/data filters for a C2 JU, including coordination, receive-to-transmit filter mirroring, filter effects and exceptions, and J7.6/J7.1 management messages.&#x27;, &#x27;actor&#x27;: &#x27;C2 JU&#x27;, &#x27;start_boundary&#x27;: &#x27;When a C2 JU establishes, activates, reports, requests, deletes, or coordinates data filters that inhibit surveillance data transmission, or when it filters surveillance tracks or IUs on receipt.&#x27;, &#x27;success_boundary&#x27;: &#x27;Surveillance transmit filters are coordinated and implemented so eligible data is inhibited or terminated as specified, protected data and messages are not filtered, and filter management/status is requested or reported using the prescribed Link 16 messages and procedures.&#x27;, &#x27;in_scope&#x27;: [&#x27;Coordination of interface/data filters with other IUs&#x27;, &#x27;Receive filters and corresponding transmit filters&#x27;, &#x27;Transmit-filter applicability to surveillance tracks, reference points, EW product information, and targets&#x27;, &#x27;Filter exceptions for alerts, emergency points, active C2 IUs, and J7.2 correlation messages&#x27;, &#x27;Filter activation effects on existing and future tracks&#x27;, &#x27;J7.6 filter implementation, description, and deletion messages&#x27;, &#x27;J7.1 filter information requests&#x27;, &#x27;Moving transmit filters&#x27;, &#x27;Filter numbering and coordination&#x27;, &#x27;Separation of message label/sublabel filters from data filters&#x27;], &#x27;out_of_scope&#x27;: [&#x27;General J3 surveillance track reporting unrelated to filtering&#x27;, &#x27;NonC2 JU use of Surveillance NPG&#x27;, &#x27;R2 correlation algorithms except where filter activation requires termination or R2-related handling&#x27;, &#x27;Detailed J3.6 covariance encoding&#x27;, &#x27;Weapon, mission, PPLI, or platform status procedures not invoked by filter management&#x27;], &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 125, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;Data filters may be used to inhibit the flow of data on a data link. A data filter that inhibits data from being transmitted on a data link is a transmit filter.&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}, {&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 132, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;The data filtering rules at sub-paragraphs a. through i. below apply to C2 JUs&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}, {&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 133, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;Management and reporting of Link 16 transmit filters are accomplished using the following messages:&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}]}</pre><h3>交互目标 / goal</h3><pre>[goal:0 / CL-fb6280a1b5fd845d] Coordinate transmit filters with all IUs by identifying filters by filter number to minimize track management problems.</pre><h3>前置条件 / preconditions</h3><pre>[preconditions:0 / CL-fae4c57975d9de74 / step 1] The use of interface filters shall be coordinated with all IUs to minimize track management problems.</pre><pre>[preconditions:1 / CL-4098ae51c2267fd0 / step 2] Filters are identified by filter number for coordination with other JUs.</pre><pre>[preconditions:2 / CL-17612517062722fc / step 3] If the C2 JU filters tracks/IUs on receipt, a transmit filter that duplicates the receive filter must be established.</pre><pre>[preconditions:3 / CL-db959f6e401a4e67 / step 4] For filtering of C2 IUs, the C2 IUs have the Simulation Indicator field set in their J2 PPLI message; active nonsimulated C2 IUs cannot be filtered.</pre><h3>触发条件 / trigger</h3><pre>[trigger:0 / CL-8a9b76b7e24ed924] A C2 JU requests or reports the insertion or deletion of transmit filters, including data forwarding filters, to coordinate with all IUs and minimize track management problems.</pre><h3>主流程 / main_flow</h3><pre>[main_flow:0 / CL-3e820bc2f86d13ec / step 1] The C2 JU requests or reports the insertion or deletion of transmit filters, including data forwarding filters, in J7.6 messages.</pre><pre>[main_flow:1 / CL-0a7991a15f90b015 / step 2] The C2 JU uses the Filter Unit Type field to indicate whether the filter applies to individual JU transmissions or forwarding unit transmissions of forwarded data.</pre><pre>[main_flow:2 / CL-14f18fb8678dcebd / step 3] For forwarding unit filters, the C2 JU requests or reports only those filters used for filtering transmissions originating on Link 16; filters for forwarding data from any other link to Link 16 are neither requested nor reported via Link 16.</pre><pre>[main_flow:3 / CL-8f84efb7e6cb5817 / step 4] The C2 JU identifies all filters by filter number for coordination with other JUs.</pre><pre>[main_flow:4 / CL-754691380071c91a / step 5] The C2 JU coordinates the use of interface filters with all IUs to minimize track management problems, using voice or other communications media.</pre><pre>[main_flow:5 / CL-1222d71ecd9580e8 / step 6] The C2 JU requests or reports track filters in separate J7.6 messages from reference point and EW product filters.</pre><pre>[main_flow:6 / CL-8d99fc996be43d56 / step 7] When a transmit filter is activated, the C2 JU ceases reporting any track for which it has R2 and which meets the filter criteria.</pre><pre>[main_flow:7 / CL-0716a289b1bd1c13 / step 8] The C2 JU applies filters to tracks initiated prior to filter activation as well as to tracks initiated while the filter is active.</pre><pre>[main_flow:8 / CL-42dbbda45afb482b / step 9] The C2 JU ensures tracks are eligible for transmission on the interface only if they are not inhibited from transmission by any of the transmission filters currently set.</pre><pre>[main_flow:9 / CL-7970c06a4167940c / step 10] The C2 JU does not request or report the use of receive filters via Link 16.</pre><pre>[main_flow:10 / CL-304d48cf854dc215 / step 11] The C2 JU may filter C2 IUs with the Simulation Indicator field set in their J2 PPLI message; active nonsimulated C2 IUs cannot be filtered.</pre><pre>[main_flow:11 / CL-674ca3f257cc863e / step 12] The C2 JU does not filter any track or nonC2 IU with an EMG IND or FT IND set to the value of 1.</pre><h3>备选流程 / alternative_flow</h3><pre>[alternative_flow:0 / CL-b7e56bfb2d6c8b36 / step 0] At main flow step 0, if the transmit filter is a special processing filter, a JU filters data based on the setting of the Special Processing Indicator field.</pre><pre>[alternative_flow:1 / CL-3402bfb835799f19 / step 0] At main flow step 0, if the transmit filter is a simulation filter, a JU filters data and IUs based on the setting of the Simulation Indicator field.</pre><pre>[alternative_flow:2 / CL-9da04fe853393ba4 / step 0] At main flow step 0, if the transmit filter is an environment/category filter, a JU filters tracks and nonC2 IUs from the space, air, surface (maritime), subsurface (maritime), and land (ground) environment/categories, as well as reference points and electronic warfare product information.</pre><pre>[alternative_flow:3 / CL-1d97a6ff952b2a31 / step 0] At main flow step 0, if the transmit filter is an ID filter, a JU filters tracks and nonC2 IUs based on their IDs; Exercise Indicator settings have no influence on ID filters, and Identity and Identity Amplifying Descriptor are filtered in the same manner.</pre><pre>[alternative_flow:4 / CL-02b65682521002bd / step 0] At main flow step 0, if the transmit filter is a geographic filter, a JU filters tracks and nonC2 IUs based on their geographic location; maximum and minimum altitude values may also be defined for each filter to describe volumes; filters can be fixed geographically, slaved to the filtering JU or some other moving reference point, or move independently.</pre><pre>[alternative_flow:5 / CL-1d585e9a3aabbcf3 / step 0] At main flow step 0, if the filter is a message label/sublabel filter, the J7.6 message shall not be used to request implementation/deletion or status of message label/sublabel filters, and this type of filter will not be reported in the J7.6 Filter Description Report; if implemented, the message label/sublabel filter shall only be used for the purposes described and shall not be used as a data filter.</pre><pre>[alternative_flow:6 / CL-68caf90517a96d13 / step 0] At main flow step 0, filters requested or reported in J7.6 do not apply to any messages other than the J2, J3, and J12 (on Needline PG) series messages listed, except a simulation filter applies to C2 IUs.</pre><pre>[alternative_flow:7 / CL-4a430841de00db4b / step 5] At main flow step 5, an exception to requesting/reporting track filters in separate J7.6 messages from reference point and EW product filters applies if in a track filter message the Unknown E/C Filter Indicator is set to value 1.</pre><pre>[alternative_flow:8 / CL-511f91fca7718fcf / step 6] At main flow step 6, if a track or nonC2 IU has an EMG IND or FT IND set to the value of 1, it shall not be filtered.</pre><pre>[alternative_flow:9 / CL-6bea719e36b9f266 / step 9] At main flow step 9, if a system filters tracks/IUs on receipt, it must establish a transmit filter which duplicates the receive filter; when a receive filter is geographically defined, the transmit filter must, where possible, be defined to permit the area filtered for transmission to be slightly larger than the area filtered for reception so that tracks entering or leaving the filtered area may be displayed to the operator to prevent dual designations.</pre><pre>[alternative_flow:10 / CL-b296b5d45ca76743 / step 10] At main flow step 10, if a C2 IU is active nonsimulated, it cannot be filtered.</pre><h3>异常流程 / exception_flow</h3><pre>[exception_flow:0 / CL-68a8eb29f9b690e2 / step 0] If the filter is a receive filter, the use of receive filters is neither requested nor reported via Link 16; exit by not requesting or reporting receive filters via Link 16.</pre><pre>[exception_flow:1 / CL-9ba6c5c644515eea / step 2] If forwarding unit filters are for forwarding data from any other link to Link 16, they are neither requested nor reported via Link 16; exit by not requesting or reporting such forwarding unit filters via Link 16.</pre><pre>[exception_flow:2 / CL-69123dde0458e1cb / step 0] If filters requested or reported in the J7.6 messages are for messages other than the J2, J3, and J12 (on Needline PG) series messages listed, they do not apply, except a simulation filter applies to C2 IUs; exit by not applying those filters to other messages.</pre><pre>[exception_flow:3 / CL-69ac7f66a6b3792c / step 6] If any track or nonC2 IU has an EMG IND or FT IND set to the value of 1, it shall not be filtered; exit by not filtering that track or nonC2 IU.</pre><pre>[exception_flow:4 / CL-295eb84a9c6362a0 / step 10] If a C2 IU is active nonsimulated, it cannot be filtered; exit by not filtering active nonsimulated C2 IUs. C2 IUs with the Simulation Indicator field set in their J2 PPLI message may be filtered.</pre><pre>[exception_flow:5 / CL-e020942041f104c1] If the storage files of a JU are filled and all applicable filters have been used, acceptance of the new data shall not be required, regardless of its ID or priority; this procedure applies to both real-time and nonrealtime data. Exit by not requiring acceptance of the new data.</pre><pre>[exception_flow:6 / CL-90a23a85b1752292] If a C2 JU is deactivating a receive filter, after initially achieving Active status or after returning to Active status from Inactive status or TDS Failure, it shall not transmit air, surface, or land tracks until sufficient reporting responsibility checks, correlation, and data registration are performed; the minimum wait before reporting air and surface tracks is 12 seconds and for land tracks is 48 seconds. Exit by delaying track transmission until the minimum wait is satisfied.</pre><h3>后置条件 / postconditions</h3><pre>[postconditions:0 / CL-6165a989249aa014 / step 1] The use of interface filters has been coordinated with all IUs to minimize track management problems.</pre><pre>[postconditions:1 / CL-98ef2496a1595e40 / step 2] All filters are identified by filter number for coordination with other JUs.</pre><pre>[postconditions:2 / CL-d4b28933c89ca14d / step 3] For any system that filters tracks/IUs on receipt, a transmit filter duplicating the receive filter has been established.</pre><pre>[postconditions:3 / CL-0d9f7334e0ada7c9 / step 4] When a receive filter is geographically defined, the transmit filter is defined, where possible, to permit the area filtered for transmission to be slightly larger than the area filtered for reception so that tracks entering or leaving the filtered area may be displayed to the operator to prevent dual designations.</pre><pre>[postconditions:4 / CL-91bfbe6873a45937 / step 5] Tracks are eligible for transmission on the interface only if they are not inhibited from transmission by any of the transmission filters currently set.</pre><pre>[postconditions:5 / CL-8f343e3fa95e0552 / step 6] Filters apply to tracks initiated prior to filter activation as well as to tracks initiated while the filter is active.</pre><pre>[postconditions:6 / CL-4795a0707f5bfbde / step 7] When a transmit filter is activated by a unit, the unit has ceased reporting any track for which it has R2 and which meets the filter criteria.</pre><pre>[postconditions:7 / CL-d390a8ec80e1aeea / step 8] Active nonsimulated C2 IUs are not filtered; C2 IUs with the Simulation Indicator field set in their J2 PPLI message may be filtered.</pre><pre>[postconditions:8 / CL-9814b4fa1de328c9 / step 9] No track or nonC2 IU with an EMG IND or FT IND set to the value of 1 is filtered.</pre>", "groups": [{"key": "coverage", "title": "逐需求覆盖", "fields": [{"key": "label", "label": "覆盖标签", "type": "select", "required": true, "options": ["FULL", "PARTIAL", "NOT_COVERED", "CONTRADICTED", "UNRESOLVED", "TECHNICAL_FAILURE"]}, {"key": "location", "label": "输出位置/断言 ID/原文；无匹配填无", "type": "textarea", "required": true}, {"key": "reason", "label": "判定理由（列出遗漏的条件、否定、顺序或结果）", "type": "textarea", "required": true}], "rows": [{"title": "UC-5d871faa2b899b9a-R0001", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;A C2 JU shall coordinate the use of interface filters with all IUs to minimize track management problems; coordination of filtering requests may be performed by voice or other communications media.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: None, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;CONFIRMED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 132, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;The use of interface filters shall be coordinated with all IUs to minimize track management problems. Coordination of filtering requests may be done by voice or other communications media.&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "UC-5d871faa2b899b9a-R0002", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;If a C2 JU filters tracks or IUs on receipt, it shall establish a transmit filter that duplicates the receive filter.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;[{&quot;condition&quot;:&quot;When tracks or IUs are filtered on receipt&quot;,&quot;result&quot;:&quot;Establish a duplicating transmit filter&quot;}]&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;CONFIRMED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 132, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;Any system which filters tracks/IUs on receipt must establish a transmit filter which duplicates the receive filter.&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "UC-5d871faa2b899b9a-R0003", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;When a receive filter is geographically defined, the corresponding transmit filter shall, where possible, be defined to permit the area filtered for transmission to be slightly larger than the area filtered for reception so that tracks entering or leaving the filtered area may be displayed to the operator to prevent dual designations.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;[{&quot;condition&quot;:&quot;The receive filter is geographically defined&quot;,&quot;result&quot;:&quot;Define the transmit-filter area slightly larger where possible&quot;}]&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;CONFIRMED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 132, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;when a receive filter is geographically defined, the transmit filter must, where possible, be defined to permit the area filtered for transmission to be slightly larger than the area filtered for reception so that tracks entering or leaving the filtered area may be displayed to the operator to prevent dual designations.&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "UC-5d871faa2b899b9a-R0004", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &quot;If a C2 JU&#x27;s storage files are filled and all applicable filters have been used, the C2 JU shall not be required to accept new data regardless of its ID or priority; this applies to both real-time and nonreal-time data.&quot;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;[{&quot;condition&quot;:&quot;Storage files are full and all applicable filters have been used&quot;,&quot;result&quot;:&quot;Acceptance of new data is not required&quot;}]&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;CONFIRMED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 132, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;If the storage files of a JU are filled and all applicable filters have been used, acceptance of the new data shall not be required, regardless of its ID or priority. This procedure applies to both real-time and nonreal-time data.&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "UC-5d871faa2b899b9a-R0005", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;A C2 JU shall not filter any track or nonC2 IU with the Emergency Indicator or Force Tell Indicator set to value 1.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;[{&quot;condition&quot;:&quot;EMG IND or FT IND is set to 1 on a track or nonC2 IU&quot;,&quot;result&quot;:&quot;The track or nonC2 IU is not filtered&quot;}]&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;CONFIRMED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 132, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;Any track or nonC2 IU with an EMG IND or FT IND set to the value of 1 shall not be filtered.&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "UC-5d871faa2b899b9a-R0006", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;A C2 JU shall not filter a J3.1 message.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: None, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;CONFIRMED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 132, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;A J3.1 message shall not be filtered.&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "UC-5d871faa2b899b9a-R0007", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;A C2 JU shall not filter active nonsimulated C2 IUs; C2 IUs with the Simulation Indicator set in their J2 PPLI message may be filtered.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;[{&quot;condition&quot;:&quot;The C2 IU is active and nonsimulated&quot;,&quot;result&quot;:&quot;The C2 IU cannot be filtered&quot;},{&quot;condition&quot;:&quot;The C2 IU has the Simulation Indicator set in its J2 PPLI message&quot;,&quot;result&quot;:&quot;The C2 IU may be filtered&quot;}]&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;CONFIRMED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 133, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;Active nonsimulated C2 IUs cannot be filtered. In other words, C2 IUs with the Simulation Indicator field set in their J2 PPLI message may be filtered.&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "UC-5d871faa2b899b9a-R0008", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;A C2 JU shall identify all filters by filter number for coordination with other JUs.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: None, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;CONFIRMED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 133, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;All filters are identified by filter number for coordination with other JUs.&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "UC-5d871faa2b899b9a-R0009", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;A C2 JU shall make a track eligible for transmission on the interface only if the track is not inhibited from transmission by any currently set transmission filter.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;[{&quot;condition&quot;:&quot;A track is inhibited by any currently set transmit filter&quot;,&quot;result&quot;:&quot;The track is not eligible for transmission&quot;}]&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;CONFIRMED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 133, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;Tracks are eligible for transmission on the interface only if they are not inhibited from transmission by any of the transmission filters currently set.&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "UC-5d871faa2b899b9a-R0010", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;A C2 JU shall apply filters to tracks initiated before filter activation and to tracks initiated while the filter is active.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: None, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;CONFIRMED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 133, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;Filters shall apply to tracks initiated prior to filter activation as well as to tracks initiated while the filter is active.&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "UC-5d871faa2b899b9a-R0011", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;When a C2 JU activates a transmit filter, it shall cease reporting any track for which it has R2 and which meets the filter criteria, and shall comply with the rules for terminating transmission of the applicable track data of the applicable Environment/Category.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;[{&quot;condition&quot;:&quot;A transmit filter is activated and an R2 track meets the filter criteria&quot;,&quot;result&quot;:&quot;Cease reporting and follow applicable track-data termination rules&quot;}]&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;CONFIRMED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 133, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;When a transmit filter is activated by a unit, the unit shall cease reporting any track for which it has R2 and which meets the filter criteria, and shall comply with the rules for terminating transmission of the applicable track data of the applicable Environment/Category.&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "UC-5d871faa2b899b9a-R0012", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;No filter shall inhibit the J7.2 Correlation message.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: None, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;CONFIRMED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 133, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;The J7.2 Correlation message shall not be inhibited by any filter.&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "UC-5d871faa2b899b9a-R0013", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;A C2 JU shall manage and report Link 16 transmit filters using J7.6 (ACT = 0) Filter Implementation Request, J7.6 (ACT = 1) Filter Description Report, J7.6 (ACT = 2) Delete Filter Request/Report, and J7.1 (ACT = 0) Data Update Request by Request Indicator messages.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: None, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;CONFIRMED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 133, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;Management and reporting of Link 16 transmit filters are accomplished using the following messages: a. J7.6 (ACT = 0) Filter Implementation Request message. b. J7.6 (ACT = 1) Filter Description Report message. c. J7.6 (ACT = 2) Delete Filter Request/Report message. d. J7.1 (ACT = 0) Data Update Request by Request Indicator message.&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "UC-5d871faa2b899b9a-R0014", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;A C2 JU shall use the J7.6 message only for transmit filters, including data forwarding filters, and not to request or report receive filters.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: None, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;CONFIRMED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 133, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;The J7.6 message only applies to transmit filters as defined in paragraph 4.7.7, i.e., it is only used to request or report the insertion or deletion of transmit filters including data forwarding filters.&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}, {&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 134, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;The use of receive filters is neither requested nor reported via Link 16.&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "UC-5d871faa2b899b9a-R0015", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;A C2 JU shall use the Filter Unit Type field to indicate whether a filter applies to individual JU transmissions or forwarding unit transmissions of forwarded data.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: None, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;CONFIRMED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 134, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;The Filter Unit Type field indicates whether the filter applies to individual JU transmissions or forwarding unit transmissions of forwarded data.&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "UC-5d871faa2b899b9a-R0016", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;A C2 JU shall not request or report forwarding-unit filters for filtering transmissions from any link other than Link 16 into Link 16.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: None, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;CONFIRMED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 134, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;Forwarding unit filters requested or reported are only those used for filtering transmissions originating on Link 16. Filters for forwarding data from any other link to Link 16 are neither requested nor reported via Link 16.&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "UC-5d871faa2b899b9a-R0017", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;In addition to the filter message, a C2 JU shall use voice coordination to ensure filter management on the interface.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: None, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;CONFIRMED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 134, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;Voice coordination is required in addition to the filter message to ensure filter management on the interface.&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "UC-5d871faa2b899b9a-R0018", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;A C2 JU shall use J7.6 (ACT = 0) to request that another JU implement a filter by specifying the filter types, parameters, inside/outside selection, and Filter Number value 0, unless a prearranged filter is requested by filter number with all Filter Indicator fields set to 0.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;[{&quot;condition&quot;:&quot;Requesting implementation of a non-prearranged filter&quot;,&quot;result&quot;:&quot;Specify types, parameters, inside/outside selection, and Filter Number 0&quot;},{&quot;condition&quot;:&quot;Requesting a prearranged filter&quot;,&quot;result&quot;:&quot;Specify the filter number and set all Filter Indicator fields to 0&quot;}]&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;CONFIRMED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 134, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;The J7.6 (ACT = 0) message is used by a JU to request that a filter be implemented by another JU. The implementation request consists of specifying the filter types and the parameters for each type and whether to filter inside or outside the defined area, with Filter Number field set to value 0. If specific filters have been prearranged, then an implementation request may consist of specifying the filter number with all Filter Indicator fields of the J7.6 (ACT = 0) set to value 0.&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "UC-5d871faa2b899b9a-R0019", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;A C2 JU shall use J7.6 (ACT = 1) to report a filter inserted into its TDS or to respond to a J7.1 (ACT = 0) message, and shall set the filter number to a value between 1 and 14.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: None, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;CONFIRMED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 134, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;The J7.6 (ACT = 1) message is used by a JU to report a filter which the JU has inserted into its TDS or to respond to a J7.1 (ACT = 0) message. The filter number shall be set to a value between 1 and 14.&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "UC-5d871faa2b899b9a-R0020", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;When J7.6 (ACT = 1) is used in response to a J7.1 (ACT = 0) message, the C2 JU shall address the filter message(s) to the JU requesting the filter information.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;[{&quot;condition&quot;:&quot;J7.6 ACT=1 responds to J7.1 ACT=0&quot;,&quot;result&quot;:&quot;Address filter messages to the requesting JU&quot;}]&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;CONFIRMED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 134, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;When used in response to a J7.1 (ACT = 0) message, the filter message(s) shall be addressed to the JU requesting the filter information.&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "UC-5d871faa2b899b9a-R0021", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;A new filter report from a C2 JU using a filter number previously received from that JU shall supersede prior filter data for that number.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: None, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;CONFIRMED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 134, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;A new filter report on a previously received filter number from a JU shall supersede prior filter data for that number.&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "UC-5d871faa2b899b9a-R0022", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;When a line or area filter requires multiple J7.6 messages with the same filter number, the C2 JU shall treat all messages as a single filter report.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;[{&quot;condition&quot;:&quot;A line or area filter requires multiple messages with the same filter number&quot;,&quot;result&quot;:&quot;Treat them as one filter report&quot;}]&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;CONFIRMED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 134, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;In the case of a line or area filter requiring multiple messages all with the same filter number to describe the line or area, all of the messages must be treated as a single filter report.&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "UC-5d871faa2b899b9a-R0023", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;Transmit filters requested or reported in J7.6 shall apply to the specified four data classes: tracks in J3.2 through J3.5 and nonC2 IUs in J2.0/J2.2 through J2.6 if Friends are filtered; reference points, lines, and areas in J3.0; EW product information in J3.7; and targets in J12.6/J12.7 on Needline PG.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: None, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;CONFIRMED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 135, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;Transmit filters requested or reported in the J7.6 message apply to four classes of data as follows:&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}, {&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 135, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;(1) Tracks - Tracks reported in J3.2 through J3.5 messages and nonC2 IUs reported in J2.0 and J2.2 through J2.6 messages if Friends are filtered.&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}, {&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 135, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;(2) Reference Points - Reference points, lines, and areas reported in J3.0 messages.&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}, {&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 135, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;(3) Electronic Warfare Product Information - Reported in J3.7 messages.&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}, {&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 135, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;(4) Targets - Targets reported in J12.6 and J12.7 messages on Needline PG.&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "UC-5d871faa2b899b9a-R0024", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;A C2 JU shall not apply J7.6 transmit filters to messages other than the listed J2, J3, and J12 Needline PG series data, except that a simulation filter applies to C2 IUs.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: None, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;CONFIRMED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 135, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;Filters requested or reported in the J7.6 messages do not apply to any messages other than the J2, J3, and J12 (on Needline PG) series messages listed above, e.g., J2 series PPLI data for C2 IUs, J6.0 Amplification data, J14.0 EW Parametric data, etc., except a simulation filter applies to C2 IUs.&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "UC-5d871faa2b899b9a-R0025", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;A C2 JU shall request or report track filters in J7.6 messages separate from reference point and EW product filters, except that an Unknown E/C Filter Indicator set to 1 in a track filter message also filters EW product data with Unknown E/C.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;[{&quot;condition&quot;:&quot;Track filter message has Unknown E/C Filter Indicator set to 1&quot;,&quot;result&quot;:&quot;Unknown E/C EW product data is also filtered&quot;}]&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;CONFIRMED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 135, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;Track filters shall be requested/reported in separate J7.6 messages from reference point and EW product filters, with the following exception: if in a track filter message the Unknown E/C Filter Indicator is set to value 1, then EW product data with Unknown E/C shall be filtered in addition to any other valid filter combination contained within that message.&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "UC-5d871faa2b899b9a-R0026", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;Because reference points have no E/C or ID, a C2 JU shall request or report point filters in J7.6 messages separate from tracks and EW product information; if the Reference Point Filter Indicator is set, the only other permitted indicators are SPI, Simulation, and, if required, Geographic Area Filter indicators.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;[{&quot;condition&quot;:&quot;Reference Point Filter Indicator is set&quot;,&quot;result&quot;:&quot;Only SPI, Simulation, and required Geographic Area Filter indicators may also be set&quot;}]&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;CONFIRMED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 136, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;Since reference points have no E/C or ID, point filters shall be requested/reported in separate J7.6 messages from tracks and EW product information, i.e., if the Reference Point Filter Indicator is set, the only other Filter Indicators that may be set are the SPI and Simulation Filter Indicators and, if required, a Geographic Area Filter.&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "UC-5d871faa2b899b9a-R0027", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;A C2 JU shall request or report EW product information filters in J7.6 messages separate from tracks and points, except that setting the Unknown E/C filter causes Unknown EW product information to be filtered regardless of the EW Filter Indicator setting.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;[{&quot;condition&quot;:&quot;Unknown E/C filter is set&quot;,&quot;result&quot;:&quot;Unknown EW product information is filtered regardless of EW Filter Indicator&quot;}]&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;CONFIRMED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 136, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;EW product information filters shall be requested/reported in separate J7.6 messages from tracks and points except that if the Unknown E/C filter is set, then Unknown EW product information are filtered regardless of the setting of the EW Filter Indicator.&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "UC-5d871faa2b899b9a-R0028", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;When the EW Filter Indicator is set in a J7.6 message, all other filter indicators in that message shall apply only to EW product information data.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;[{&quot;condition&quot;:&quot;EW Filter Indicator is set&quot;,&quot;result&quot;:&quot;Other indicators apply only to EW product information&quot;}]&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;CONFIRMED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 136, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;When the EW Filter Indicator is set, then all other Filter Indicators set in the same message apply only to EW product information data.&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "UC-5d871faa2b899b9a-R0029", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;If a Geographic Area Filter and EW Filter Indicator are set, the C2 JU shall filter EW fixes within or outside the area, EW AOPs whose centers are within or outside the area, and EW LOBs whose origins are within or outside the area.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;[{&quot;condition&quot;:&quot;Geographic Area Filter and EW Filter Indicator are set&quot;,&quot;result&quot;:&quot;Filter the specified EW fixes, AOPs, and LOBs according to inside/outside selection&quot;}]&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;CONFIRMED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 136, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;If a Geographic Area Filter is set and the EW Filter Indicator is set, then all EW Fixes within/out the area and all EW AOPs having their center within/out the area and all EW LOBs with origin within/out the area are filtered.&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "UC-5d871faa2b899b9a-R0030", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;If a Geographic Area Filter and Reference Point Filter Indicator are set, the C2 JU shall filter points within or outside the area, lines whose points are all within or outside the area, and areas completely within or outside the area.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;[{&quot;condition&quot;:&quot;Geographic Area Filter and Reference Point Filter Indicator are set&quot;,&quot;result&quot;:&quot;Filter the specified points, lines, and areas according to inside/outside selection&quot;}]&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;CONFIRMED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 136, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;If a Geographic Area Filter is set and the Reference Point Filter Indicator is set, then all points within/out the area, all lines with all points within/out the area, and all areas completely within/out the area are filtered.&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "UC-5d871faa2b899b9a-R0031", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;For moving filters, a C2 JU shall set the Slaved Indicator to value 1 when the J7.6C3 continuation word is included.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;[{&quot;condition&quot;:&quot;J7.6C3 is included for a moving filter&quot;,&quot;result&quot;:&quot;Set Slaved Indicator to 1&quot;}]&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;CONFIRMED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 136, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;Moving filters are specified using the J7.6I Slaved Indicator and the J7.6C3 continuation word. The Slaved Indicator must be set to value 1 if the J7.6C3 word is included.&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "UC-5d871faa2b899b9a-R0032", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;If a moving filter is slaved to an existing TN, the C2 JU shall report that TN as TN, Related and set Course and Speed to No Statement.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;[{&quot;condition&quot;:&quot;Moving filter is slaved to an existing TN&quot;,&quot;result&quot;:&quot;Report TN, Related; Course and Speed are No Statement&quot;}]&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;CONFIRMED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 136, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;If the filter is slaved to an existing TN, the TN shall be reported as TN, Related with Course and Speed set to No Statement.&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "UC-5d871faa2b899b9a-R0033", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;If Latitude and Longitude in J7.6E0 are set to No Statement for a slaved moving filter, the C2 JU shall use the position of TN, Related instead.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;[{&quot;condition&quot;:&quot;J7.6E0 Latitude and Longitude are No Statement&quot;,&quot;result&quot;:&quot;Use position of TN, Related&quot;}]&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;CONFIRMED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 136, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;If Latitude and Longitude in the J7.6EO are set to No Statement, then the position of TN, Related shall be used instead of the J7.6E0 Latitude and Longitude.&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "UC-5d871faa2b899b9a-R0034", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;If a filter moves independently of any other TN, the C2 JU shall set TN, Related to No Statement and specify Course and Speed.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;[{&quot;condition&quot;:&quot;Filter moves independently&quot;,&quot;result&quot;:&quot;TN, Related is No Statement; Course and Speed are specified&quot;}]&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;CONFIRMED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 136, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;If the filter is to move independently of any other TN, then TN, Related shall be set to No Statement with Course and Speed specified.&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "UC-5d871faa2b899b9a-R0035", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;Movement of a filter shall begin at the time of transmission of the J7.6 (ACT = 1) filter description report.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: None, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;CONFIRMED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 136, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;Movement of the filter shall begin at the time of transmission of the J7.6 (ACT = 1) filter description report.&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "UC-5d871faa2b899b9a-R0036", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &quot;If fixed geographic points are used in the initial filter description, the C2 JU shall update them in subsequent reports of the same filter based on movement of TN, Related or the filter&#x27;s course and speed.&quot;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;[{&quot;condition&quot;:&quot;Initial filter description uses fixed geographic points&quot;,&quot;result&quot;:&quot;Update them in subsequent reports according to the related TN or filter movement&quot;}]&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;CONFIRMED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 137, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &quot;If fixed geographic points are used in the initial filter description, they shall be updated in any subsequent reports of the same filter based on the movement of TN, Related or the filter&#x27;s course and speed.&quot;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "UC-5d871faa2b899b9a-R0037", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;A C2 JU shall use J7.6 (ACT = 2) to request that an addressed JU delete a filter or all filters, or to report deletion of one or all of its own filters.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: None, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;CONFIRMED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 137, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;The J7.6 (ACT = 2) message is used by a JU to request that a filter or all filters be deleted by an addressed JU. A JU may also report the deletion of one or all of its filters with this message.&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "UC-5d871faa2b899b9a-R0038", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;When a C2 JU deletes a filter, it shall use TN address 00177 octal in the J7.6 (ACT = 2) message.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;[{&quot;condition&quot;:&quot;A C2 JU deletes a filter&quot;,&quot;result&quot;:&quot;Use TN address 00177 octal&quot;}]&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;CONFIRMED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 137, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;A TN address of 00177 octal shall be used when a JU deletes a filter.&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "UC-5d871faa2b899b9a-R0039", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &quot;A C2 JU shall use filter number 15 to indicate all of a JU&#x27;s filters.&quot;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: None, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;CONFIRMED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 137, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &quot;A filter number of 15 shall be used to indicate all of a JU&#x27;s filters.&quot;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "UC-5d871faa2b899b9a-R0040", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;A C2 JU requesting information on a filter shall use the J7.1 (ACT = 0) message addressed to a specific JU and shall not use the collective address 00177 octal.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: None, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;CONFIRMED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 137, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;The J7.1 (ACT = 0) message shall be used by a JU requesting information on a filter. When used, the J7.1 (ACT = 0) message shall be addressed to a specific JU; i.e., the collective address of 00177 octal shall not be used.&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "UC-5d871faa2b899b9a-R0041", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;A C2 JU receiving a J7.1 filter-information request shall transmit either all locally inserted filters in response to Filter Number 15, or parameters for the specific filter identified by the Filter Number field.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;[{&quot;condition&quot;:&quot;Received Filter Number is 15&quot;,&quot;result&quot;:&quot;Transmit all locally inserted filters&quot;},{&quot;condition&quot;:&quot;Received Filter Number identifies a specific filter&quot;,&quot;result&quot;:&quot;Transmit that filter\\&#x27;s parameters&quot;}]&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;CONFIRMED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 137, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;The JU receiving the request shall transmit either all locally inserted filters in response to Filter Number equal to 15 or parameters on a specific filter as specified by the Filter Number field in the J7.1 (ACT = 0) message.&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "UC-5d871faa2b899b9a-R0042", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;A C2 JU shall not set the J7.1 (ACT = 0) Filter Number field to 0 when the Filter Data Request Indicator is set to 1.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;[{&quot;condition&quot;:&quot;Filter Data Request Indicator is 1&quot;,&quot;result&quot;:&quot;Filter Number field shall not be 0&quot;}]&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;CONFIRMED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 137, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;The J7.1 (ACT = 0) Filter Number field shall not be set to value 0 when the Filter Data Request Indicator is set to value 1.&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "UC-5d871faa2b899b9a-R0043", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;When a C2 JU deletes a filter that it had reported, it should transmit a J7.6 (ACT = 2) message.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;[{&quot;condition&quot;:&quot;Deleted filter was reported by the C2 JU&quot;,&quot;result&quot;:&quot;Transmit J7.6 ACT=2&quot;}]&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;CONFIRMED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 137, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;When a JU deletes a filter which it had reported, it should transmit a J7.6 (ACT = 2) message.&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "UC-5d871faa2b899b9a-R0044", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;A C2 JU shall drop remote filters when it receives a J7.6 (ACT = 2) message.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;[{&quot;condition&quot;:&quot;J7.6 ACT=2 is received&quot;,&quot;result&quot;:&quot;Drop the remote filter&quot;}]&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;CONFIRMED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 137, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;Remote filters shall be dropped when a J7.6 (ACT = 2) message is received.&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "UC-5d871faa2b899b9a-R0045", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;Because filter messages are nonredundant, a C2 JU should have the capability to drop remote filter reports from its own system.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: None, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;CONFIRMED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 137, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;Filter messages are nonredundant messages, and each JU should have the capability to drop remote filter reports from its own system.&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "UC-5d871faa2b899b9a-R0046", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;A C2 JU shall treat message label/sublabel filters as a separate category from data filters and shall not restrict their use by the data filter rules.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: None, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;CONFIRMED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 125, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;The message label/sublabel filter shall be considered a separate category of filter from data filters, and its use shall not be restricted by the data filter rules described in paragraph 4.7.7.8.&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "UC-5d871faa2b899b9a-R0047", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;A C2 JU shall use message label/sublabel filters only for receive-only filtering of messages it does not implement because of mission, platform capabilities, or platform restrictions.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: None, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;CONFIRMED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 125, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;use of these filters is restricted to receive only filtering for those messages which the JU does not implement due to the mission or particular capabilities/restrictions of that platform.&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "UC-5d871faa2b899b9a-R0048", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;A C2 JU shall not use J7.6 to request implementation, deletion, or status of message label/sublabel filters, and shall not report such filters in the J7.6 Filter Description Report.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: None, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;CONFIRMED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 125, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;The J7.6 message shall not be used to request implementation/deletion or status of message label/sublabel filters, and this type of filter will not be reported in the J7.6 Filter Description Report.&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "UC-5d871faa2b899b9a-R0049", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;A C2 JU shall not use a message label/sublabel filter as a data filter or to avoid data forwarding requirements.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: None, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;CONFIRMED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 125, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;If implemented, the message label/sublabel filter shall only be used for the purposes described above, i.e. it shall not be used as a data filter.&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}, {&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 125, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;A message label/sublabel filter shall not be used to avoid the data forwarding requirements as set forth in Appendix C, Data Forwarding.&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "UC-5d871faa2b899b9a-R0050", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;A C2 JU shall treat targets reported in J12.7 messages as EW Product information for the purposes of environment/category filtering.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: None, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 133, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;Targets reported in J12.7 messages shall be processed as EW Product information for the purposes of environment/category filtering.&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}]}</pre>"}], "repeat": false, "min_rows": 0}], "blockers": [], "requirement_meta": [{"id": "UC-5d871faa2b899b9a-R0001", "status": "CONFIRMED"}, {"id": "UC-5d871faa2b899b9a-R0002", "status": "CONFIRMED"}, {"id": "UC-5d871faa2b899b9a-R0003", "status": "CONFIRMED"}, {"id": "UC-5d871faa2b899b9a-R0004", "status": "CONFIRMED"}, {"id": "UC-5d871faa2b899b9a-R0005", "status": "CONFIRMED"}, {"id": "UC-5d871faa2b899b9a-R0006", "status": "CONFIRMED"}, {"id": "UC-5d871faa2b899b9a-R0007", "status": "CONFIRMED"}, {"id": "UC-5d871faa2b899b9a-R0008", "status": "CONFIRMED"}, {"id": "UC-5d871faa2b899b9a-R0009", "status": "CONFIRMED"}, {"id": "UC-5d871faa2b899b9a-R0010", "status": "CONFIRMED"}, {"id": "UC-5d871faa2b899b9a-R0011", "status": "CONFIRMED"}, {"id": "UC-5d871faa2b899b9a-R0012", "status": "CONFIRMED"}, {"id": "UC-5d871faa2b899b9a-R0013", "status": "CONFIRMED"}, {"id": "UC-5d871faa2b899b9a-R0014", "status": "CONFIRMED"}, {"id": "UC-5d871faa2b899b9a-R0015", "status": "CONFIRMED"}, {"id": "UC-5d871faa2b899b9a-R0016", "status": "CONFIRMED"}, {"id": "UC-5d871faa2b899b9a-R0017", "status": "CONFIRMED"}, {"id": "UC-5d871faa2b899b9a-R0018", "status": "CONFIRMED"}, {"id": "UC-5d871faa2b899b9a-R0019", "status": "CONFIRMED"}, {"id": "UC-5d871faa2b899b9a-R0020", "status": "CONFIRMED"}, {"id": "UC-5d871faa2b899b9a-R0021", "status": "CONFIRMED"}, {"id": "UC-5d871faa2b899b9a-R0022", "status": "CONFIRMED"}, {"id": "UC-5d871faa2b899b9a-R0023", "status": "CONFIRMED"}, {"id": "UC-5d871faa2b899b9a-R0024", "status": "CONFIRMED"}, {"id": "UC-5d871faa2b899b9a-R0025", "status": "CONFIRMED"}, {"id": "UC-5d871faa2b899b9a-R0026", "status": "CONFIRMED"}, {"id": "UC-5d871faa2b899b9a-R0027", "status": "CONFIRMED"}, {"id": "UC-5d871faa2b899b9a-R0028", "status": "CONFIRMED"}, {"id": "UC-5d871faa2b899b9a-R0029", "status": "CONFIRMED"}, {"id": "UC-5d871faa2b899b9a-R0030", "status": "CONFIRMED"}, {"id": "UC-5d871faa2b899b9a-R0031", "status": "CONFIRMED"}, {"id": "UC-5d871faa2b899b9a-R0032", "status": "CONFIRMED"}, {"id": "UC-5d871faa2b899b9a-R0033", "status": "CONFIRMED"}, {"id": "UC-5d871faa2b899b9a-R0034", "status": "CONFIRMED"}, {"id": "UC-5d871faa2b899b9a-R0035", "status": "CONFIRMED"}, {"id": "UC-5d871faa2b899b9a-R0036", "status": "CONFIRMED"}, {"id": "UC-5d871faa2b899b9a-R0037", "status": "CONFIRMED"}, {"id": "UC-5d871faa2b899b9a-R0038", "status": "CONFIRMED"}, {"id": "UC-5d871faa2b899b9a-R0039", "status": "CONFIRMED"}, {"id": "UC-5d871faa2b899b9a-R0040", "status": "CONFIRMED"}, {"id": "UC-5d871faa2b899b9a-R0041", "status": "CONFIRMED"}, {"id": "UC-5d871faa2b899b9a-R0042", "status": "CONFIRMED"}, {"id": "UC-5d871faa2b899b9a-R0043", "status": "CONFIRMED"}, {"id": "UC-5d871faa2b899b9a-R0044", "status": "CONFIRMED"}, {"id": "UC-5d871faa2b899b9a-R0045", "status": "CONFIRMED"}, {"id": "UC-5d871faa2b899b9a-R0046", "status": "CONFIRMED"}, {"id": "UC-5d871faa2b899b9a-R0047", "status": "CONFIRMED"}, {"id": "UC-5d871faa2b899b9a-R0048", "status": "CONFIRMED"}, {"id": "UC-5d871faa2b899b9a-R0049", "status": "CONFIRMED"}, {"id": "UC-5d871faa2b899b9a-R0050", "status": "REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED"}], "no_content": false, "material_sha256": "351991dd166c3c29b93e39b701de14c0aeea5efb0b7457f2559da7103704083e"};
